### 3. The Visual Styling (CSS)
Save this as `style.css` to apply the design.

```css
:root {
    --primary: #4a4031; /* Dark Stone */
    --accent: #d4a373;  /* Terracotta */
    --bg: #fefae0;      /* Parchment */
    --text: #283618;    /* Deep Olive */
    --white: #ffffff;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    background-color: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.6;
}

h1, h2, .logo {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
}

/* Navigation */
header {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 1rem 5%;
}

nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
}

nav ul {
    display: flex;
    list-style: none;
}

nav ul li {
    margin-left: 20px;
}

nav a {
    color: var(--white);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
}

/* Hero Section */
.hero {
    padding: 4rem 10%;
    text-align: center;
}

.intro h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.intro p {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
}

.search-container {
    display: flex;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

.search-container input {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 1rem;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px 0 0 4px;
}

.search-container button {
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    background: var(--accent);
    border: none;
    color: white;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
}

/* Grid Layout */
.grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
}

.card {
    background: var(--white);
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-align: left;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
}

.card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
}

.img-placeholder {
    background: #e2e2e2;
    height: 200px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
}

.view-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
}

/* Artifact Page Specifics */
.artifact-container {
    padding: 3rem 5%;
}

.artifact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
}

.main-image {
    background: #ccc;
    height: 500px;
    border-radius: 8px;
}

.thumbnails {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 1rem;
}

.thumb {
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    background: #ddd;
    border-radius: 4px;
}

.catalog-id {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #666;
}

.context-box {
    background: rgba(212, 163, 115, 0.1);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    margin-top: 2rem;
}

.mini-map {
    height: 150px;
